From: Luc3as <luc3as@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 17:39:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/25] A delivery history page, and /pause in the bot
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

"Items are found but nothing arrives" was the first question this project
got asked, and the answer lived in docker logs. /history now lists every
notification newest first — the listing, its kind (new, price drop, verdict),
which search found it, which destination it went to, its status with the last
error and attempt count, and for a held alert how long until it is due — with
filters by search and status. The same as JSON at /api/history. The header
gained a small nav between searches and history.

/pause <id> joins /resume <id> in the Telegram bot, sharing one handler.
